  "source_brief": {
    "silhouette": "A tall broad-shouldered figure with a short circular shoulder mantle, compact fantasy axe and a visibly open stance. The weapon and torso create a diagonal, not Dagna\u2019s horizontal bar.",
    "face": "Olive-green skin, small rounded tusks, warm amber eyes and black hair tied in a short topknot. Keep the expression determined but friendly, avoiding a permanent snarl.",
    "costume": "Sun-ochre woven mantle over brown padded armor, a red waist sash and practical high boots. The armor uses clean geometric plates with broad woven bands.",
    "palette": "Ochre #CAA454; red earth #A95E4D; dark leather #5E5040; muted green skin #6E8260.",
    "equipment": "A single broad stylized axe carried one-handed, with an open off-hand for balance. Its proportions communicate fantasy rather than realistic manufacturing.",
    "signature": "Round ochre mantle, topknot, and broad diagonal axe silhouette.",
    "materials": "Thick cloth, oiled hide, brushed iron and a restrained sun-pattern stitch. No spikes or trophy clutter.",
    "back": "A wide sash knot sits on one hip; the mantle is stiff enough for a short bone chain instead of simulation.",
    "animation": "Idle squares shoulders and rolls weight between feet. Basics use alternating short attacks. The active takes a clear breath and sets a quicker rhythm with a firm foot plant, not a transformation.",
    "vfx": "Three short amber speed marks rise from the arms and fade; the buff remains visible as a small icon, not a continuous flame layer.",
    "audio": "Rhythmic hand-drum accent and a restrained exhale, with ordinary attack impacts at the new cadence.",
    "risk": "Large proportions need a broad rig variant rather than scaling a human mesh uniformly. Keep hands and axe away from face during tempo changes."
  },
